# SP+ coaching tips, stage 2 (second week): combining information. Shown only
# once the advisor has actually used Fin several times -- see fin-tips.
w2-09	Give Fin two versions of a document and ask it to show only what changed.
w2-10	Give Fin several statements and ask it to put the important information into a spreadsheet.
w2-11	Ask Fin to find every mention of a person, date, or amount across the documents you are reviewing.
w2-12	Ask Fin to prepare a one-page brief for tomorrow's meeting from the documents you choose.
w2-13	When information is missing or does not agree, ask Fin to draft the questions you need to send.
w2-14	Ask Fin to check a letter against your own review checklist before you send it.
w2-15	Fin can give a group of documents consistent names and show you exactly what it changed.
